progress.update(next_root_index=312,next_root_id=ASSIGN['roots'][312]['id'] if len(ASSIGN['roots'])>312 else None,status='frozen',active_batch=None,active_script=None,active_written_words=0,active_note='st61 frozen:4roots43new90examples;5 internal exclusions. All words/roots IPA/split/history/prose/examples self-reviewed. Exact global object-word dedup, original catalog coverage and family references passed. Can two sources, cunning alternate routes, every Old English combination, everlasting chronology, says pronunciation, concise conjunction uses. No images/ZIP.')
